#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2278 expect=violation domain=PC
#note "present-but-missing case (the same empty(PCLLOQ) leaf that carries column absence since Plan B phase 4d'): the 'BLQ' record on row 1 has no PCLLOQ value -> fires; row 2 carries it."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 PCSTRESC=BLQ
dataset PC label="Pharmacokinetics Concentrations"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col PCSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col PCTESTCD type=Char label="Test Short Name"
col PCSTRESC type=Char label="Standardized Result in Character Format"
col PCLLOQ   type=Num  label="Lower Limit of Quantitation"
col PCSPEC   type=Char label="Specimen Material Type"
---
STUDY01 | PC | STUDY01-001 | 1 | DRUGX | BLQ | .   | PLASMA
STUDY01 | PC | STUDY01-002 | 1 | DRUGX | BQL | 0.5 | PLASMA
